Package: engrampa
Version: @@VERSION@@
Architecture: @@ARCH@@
Maintainer: himaps <himaps@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: @@DEPENDS@@
Recommends: @@RECOMMENDS@@
Homepage: https://mate-desktop.org
Description: MATE archive manager for Kylin V10 SP1
 Engrampa 1.28.5 archive manager, built on the same (Ubuntu 20.04/focal)
 baseline as Kylin V10 SP1 desktop.
 .
 Supports drag-and-drop extraction to file manager/desktop, double-click
 open (with change write-back into the archive), and auto-unit size
 display.
 .
 External format backends (p7zip, zip/unzip, unar, cpio, ...) are
 installed on demand via Recommends or by engrampa-offline.
 面向银河麒麟 V10 SP1 (arm64) 的 Engrampa 1.28.5 归档管理器。
 与目标系统同源构建(Ubuntu 20.04 基线, glibc 2.31)。
